  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **I Was Nothing**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Right to the Ways and the Rules of the World**: back after 59 archived shows (667 days) [2]\n- **Suckin the Blood From the Devil's Dick**: rare: 8 archived performances [2]\n- **The Stallion, Part 5**: back after 49 archived shows (598 days); rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Can U Taste the Waste?**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Strap On That Jammy Pac**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2023-08-01** (recommended): audience recording; 36 songs; 161 min [1]. Said about its sound: There is a slight stereo shift caused by the crowd, though it is not drastic [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The taper was given space at front-of-house by the Ween crew [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2023-08-01**: taped by opsopcopolis; transferred by opsopcopolis; source: AUD [1]. Also: Recorded with a Berliner CM33 mic into a Zoom F8, then edited in ProTools and encoded to FLAC with xACT [1]",
